  "ruleText": "Cor 407.14 Notification to Residents of Classification and Re-entry Plan Recommendations. The classification staff shall notify the resident in writing of the classification evaluation results on the “Unit Classification Evaluation and Re-entry Planning” form via unit staff.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Cor 400) #12777, eff 5-11-19",
